<li><a href="https://www.dragos.com/blog/ai-supply-chain-security-canary-tokens">Dragos: Three breaches, endless leaks</a></li>
<li><a href="https://www.together.ai/blog/security-event-prompt-leakage-for-requests-in-june-and-july-of-2026">Together AI: Security event — prompt leakage</a></li>
<li><a href="https://phala.com/posts/phala-november-preliminary-incident-report">Phala: November preliminary incident report</a></li>
<li><a href="https://openrouter.ai/blog/insights/zero-data-retention/">OpenRouter: Zero Data Retention (ZDR)</a></li>
<li><a href="https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50582794">Ars Technica: Leaky AI supply chain exposing secret user data</a></li>
</ul>
`;
